        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Strikes - A School of War, But Not the War Itself</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    background: #888;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 30px;\n    font-family: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .poster {\n    background: #eee7da;\n    width: 700px;\n    padding: 15px;\n    border: 3px solid #ccc;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .frame {\n    background: #000;\n    padding: 4px;\n  }\n  .header {\n    background: #000;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding: 15px 10px 10px 10px;\n  }\n  .header .strikes {\n    color: #d81e2c;\n    font-family: \"Arial Black\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 78px;\n    letter-spacing: -2px;\n    line-height: 1;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n  .header .subtitle {\n    color: #fff;\n    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 25px;\n    line-height: 1.25;\n    margin-left: 10px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n  .intro-text {\n    background: #eee7da;\n    color: #b5202e;\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n    padding: 12px 18px 8px 18px;\n    text-align: justify;\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-family: \"Times New Roman\", Georgia, serif;\n  }\n  .photo-area {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 780px;\n    background: #ddd;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #444;\n    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    background: repeating-linear-gradient(\n      45deg,\n      #cfcfcf,\n      #cfcfcf 10px,\n      #bfbfbf 10px,\n      #bfbfbf 20px\n    );\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    border: 1px dashed #666;\n    padding: 10px;\n  }\n  .footer-text {\n    background: #eee7da;\n    color: #b5202e;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n    padding: 12px 18px 8px 18px;\n    font-family: \"Times New Roman\", Georgia, serif;\n  }\n  .footer-text .signature {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    margin-left: 8px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"poster\">\n  <div class=\"frame\">\n\n    <div class=\"header\">\n      <div class=\"strikes\">STRIKES</div>\n      <div class=\"subtitle\">A SCHOOL OF WAR ,<br>BUT NOT THE WAR ITSELF.</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"intro-text\">\n      A strike teaches workers to understand what the strength\n      of the employers and what the strength of the workers con-\n      sists in; it teaches them not to think of their own employer\n      alone and not of their own immediate workmates alone but\n      of all the employers, the whole class of capitalists and the\n      whole class of workers.\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"photo-area\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">\n        [Photo: black and white crowd scene of a strike demonstration with police officers in helmets in the foreground, people climbing on a bus/structure in the background, and a large red union banner with a white ribbon-style scroll and an image of a building in the upper right area of the photo]\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"footer-text\">\n      A strike, moreover, opens the eyes of the workers to the\n      nature, not only of the capitalists, but of the government\n      and the laws as well. <span class=\"signature\">LENIN</span>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
